  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left(\\frac{1+5 x^2}{1+3 x^2}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{x^2}}=\\mathrm{e}^{\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1}{x^2}\\left(\\frac{1+5 x^2}{1+3 x^2}-1\\right)}=\\mathrm{e}^{\\operatorname{Lim}_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{2 x^2}{x^2\\left(1+3 x^2\\right)}}=\\mathrm{e}^2$",
    "image": null
  },
